    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2. 求式$2+5^3$的值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0221#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式$2+5^3$是由同样的两部分2和$5^3$所组成，因此：$2+5^3=2+125=127$（图156）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0221#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把1个数分解质因数时，可以用幂表示. 如：$504=2\\times2\\times2\\times3\\times3\\times7=2^3\\times3^2\\times7$.$10\\ 000=2\\times5\\times2\\times5\\times2\\times5\\times2\\times5=2^4\\times5^4$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0221#10"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
